  gameMenus: {fileID: 690646161}
  introLine1: "Whoa\u2014easy! You're not one of those... things. Thank god. I thought
    I was the only one down here."
  introLine2: One minute I'm lacing up for Game 7, the next... I'm falling. What
    is this place? And why is everything trying to kill us?
  controlsHint: Listen up. A and D to move. W or Space to jump. E to shoot. Use Up
    and Down arrows to aim your shot. Press T to toggle the aim line. Don't miss.
  lebronPortrait: {fileID: -7113218830467206786, guid: 8554cec6f09864604a493f1956ac26a9, type: 3}
  deathHints:
  - "You can't fake your way through pain \u2014 learn from it."
  - Timing beats talent.
  - Watch your step, youngblood.
  - The curse feeds on mistakes.
  - Defense wins championships... stay alive.
  isFinalLevel: 1
  outroManager: {fileID: 0}
